eathing and oxygenation indicators.","targetId":"equipment:monitor","action":5,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-2-5-equipment-monitor-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-2-5-equipment-chart-probe-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-2"},{"title":"Check the medication order","instruction":"Touch the prescription dock with the labeled medicine. Match patient, medicine, route and the supplied order.","targetId":"equipment:prescribed-care","action":5,"toolId":"medication","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-2-5-equipment-prescribed-care-medication-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-2-5-equipment-monitor-probe-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-3"},{"title":"Prepare the prescribed route","instruction":"Join the prepared administration set to its labeled port.","targetId":"equipment:prescribed-care","action":4,"toolId":"connector","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-2-4-equipment-prescribed-care-connector-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-2-5-equipment-prescribed-care-medication-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-4"},{"title":"Administer the ordered treatment","instruction":"Seat the checked medicine in its administration port. Hold the trigger to represent the prescribed administration.","targetId":"equipment:prescribed-care","action":6,"toolId":"medication","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-2-6-equipment-prescribed-care-medication-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-2-4-equipment-prescribed-care-connector-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-5"},{"title":"Apply the oxygen order","instruction":"Fit the support mask to the virtual patient. The case uses its supplied oxygen order.","targetId":"equipment:mouthpiece","action":6,"toolId":"oxygen","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-2-6-equipment-mouthpiece-oxygen-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-2-6-equipment-prescribed-care-medication-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-6"},{"title":"Recheck respiratory support","instruction":"Return the monitoring probe to the finger. Compare the response with baseline.","targetId":"equipment:monitor","action":5,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-2-5-equipment-monitor-probe-1","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-2-6-equipment-mouthpiece-oxygen-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-7"},{"title":"Review the follow-up timeline","instruction":"Probe the affected lobe. Watch the days-and-weeks timeline; recovery is gradual.","targetId":"MAL_RLL","action":8,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-2-8-mal_rll-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-2-5-equipment-monitor-probe-1"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-8"}],"protectedIds":["REC_Right_Phrenic_nerve"]}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id,version) DO UPDATE SET definition=excluded.definition;
INSERT INTO public.thorax_learning_definitions (id, version, definition) VALUES ('pleural-effusion-0-0', '2026.09.2', '{"id":"pleural-effusion-0-0","unitId":"pleural-effusion","version":"2026.09.2","mode":0,"difficulty":0,"ordered":true,"briefing":"A symptomatic right pleural collection has been selected for ultrasound-guided therapeutic aspiration. One coached step and one needed instrument are shown at a time.","debrief":"Fluid removal relieves compression in this case. Monitor symptoms and the puncture site; send the planned sample and investigate why fluid accumulated. Fictional, fixed-indication learning scenario. Responses are illustrative and time-compressed. The model does not establish clinical competence or predict a real patient outcome.","objectives":[{"title":"Find the pleural collection","instruction":"Select the right parietal pleura. Identify fluid outside the lower lung.","targetId":"REC_Right_Parietal_Pleura","action":3,"toolId":"","equipmentState":"","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-3-rec_right_parietal_pleura-hand-0","essential":true,"weight":1,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":[],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-0"},{"title":"Check the patient and plan","instruction":"Review the aspiration indication and bleeding-risk assessment. Touch the chart with the assessment pointer. Check identity, consent, allergies and the agreed treatment.","targetId":"equipment:chart","action":5,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-5-equipment-chart-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pleural-effusion-0-0-3-rec_right_parietal_pleura-hand-0"],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-1"},{"title":"Locate fluid with ultrasound","instruction":"Hold the ultrasound probe at the side-window. Identify fluid above the diaphragm and outside the lung.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-site","action":5,"toolId":"ultrasound","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-5-equipment-pleural-site-ultrasound-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pleural-effusion-0-0-5-equipment-chart-probe-0"],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-2"},{"title":"Prepare the skin","instruction":"Use the swab over the ultrasound-selected window.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-site","action":6,"toolId":"swab","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-6-equipment-pleural-site-swab-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pleural-effusion-0-0-5-equipment-pleural-site-ultrasound-0"],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-3"},{"title":"Represent local anaesthesia","instruction":"Place the checked anaesthetic syringe at the entry target.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-site","action":6,"toolId":"anaesthetic","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-6-equipment-pleural-site-anaesthetic-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pleural-effusion-0-0-6-equipment-pleural-site-swab-0"],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-4"},{"title":"Prepare controlled aspiration","instruction":"Connect the syringe and collection circuit. This case uses controlled aspiration without wall suction.","targetId":"equipment:aspiration","action":4,"toolId":"connector","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-4-equipment-aspiration-connector-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pleural-effusion-0-0-6-equipment-pleural-site-anaesthetic-0"],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-5"},{"title":"Advance the aspiration catheter","instruction":"Follow the short channel above the lower rib. Stop in the fluid; preserve deeper lung and diaphragm.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-end","action":7,"toolId":"aspirator","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-7-equipment-pleural-end-aspirator-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0.95,"prerequisites":["pleural-effusion-0-0-4-equipment-aspiration-connector-0"],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-6"},{"title":"Begin slow aspiration","instruction":"Hold the aspiration control and watch the fluid fall. A symptom cue will ask you to pause.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-end","action":6,"toolId":"aspirator","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-6-equipment-pleural-end-aspirator-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pleural-effusion-0-0-7-equipment-pleural-end-aspirator-0"],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-7"},{"title":"Stop and check new chest discomfort","instruction":"Release aspiration. Touch the monitoring station with the probe to record the symptom check.","targetId":"equipment:monitor","action":5,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-5-equipment-monitor-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pleural-effusion-0-0-6-equipment-pleural-end-aspirator-0"],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-8"},{"title":"Withdraw and dress the site","instruction":"Withdraw the aspiration catheter along the return markers. The dressing is applied after removal.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-withdrawal","action":7,"toolId":"aspirator","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-7-equipment-pleural-withdrawal-aspirator-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0.95,"prerequisites":["pleural-effusion-0-0-5-equipment-monitor-probe-0"],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-9"},{"title":"Review symptoms and the cause","instruction":"Probe the right lower lobe. Compare expansion and review the fluid investigation plan.","targetId":"MAL_RLL","action":8,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pleural-effusion-0-0-8-mal_rll-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pleural-effusion-0-0-7-equipment-pleural-withdrawal-aspirator-0"],"narration":"pleural-effusion-step-10"}],"protectedIds":["FMA13295","REC_Right_IC6_Nerve","REC_Right_IC6_Artery","MAL_RLL"]}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id,version) DO UPDATE SET definition=excluded.definition;
